  "scoring_key_verified": false,
  "notes": "UNVALIDATED. Ten dimensions rated 1–7 three ways: self when alone, self when with partner, and a mirror rating of how the partner becomes when with me. Per person: gap = self_with_partner − self_alone (build prompt convention). Couple-level: a loop on a dimension when A's gap and B's gap have opposite signs and both are at least 2 in magnitude, flagged once as a shared pattern. The written attribution question is asked in the color layer only where the two self ratings differ by 2 or more. Item text is original content from docs/question_inventory.md and is populated here.",
  "pass_prompts": {
    "self_alone": "Left to yourself, where are you?",
    "self_with_partner": "With your partner, where do you find yourself?",
    "partner_becomes": "With me, my partner seems to become more ___."
  },
  "attribution_prompt": "If those differ: why do you think you shift?",
